{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-4","storyName":"小雪崩","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"望私自放走被炎国军队追杀的矩兽，引起朔的不满。面对除岁之事，朔主张循正道徐徐图之，望则急求破局之策，二人矛盾激化。令出面说和，并向望解释了自己从岁手下保全家人的设想。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["望","决绝的山海众成员","大炎边军","略带酒意的钦差","受宠若惊的士兵","朔","酩酊大醉的钦差","令"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_bg_70_g7_suilingcore.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14mini/m_sys_act14mini_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"subtitle","text":"无故的执念，无根的挣扎，无谓的牺牲......自从数百年前起，你就一直忧心如焚。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我的醒觉被你划分成四五百个周期，每个周期再分为十二，再分为三十，再分，再分......","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"每一分，每一秒，你都在盘算，都在恐惧着那个不知何时到来的“大限”......","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不过几场梦的时间罢了，我的我何时浅陋到如此地步？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","duration":"1","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"若是没有一个意志，没有一个主体，没有一个愿意为时间定下刻度的人，那么光阴只是无谓的轮转......","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"一如你在陵中度过的岁月。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"无知无觉的你，又有何资格定义这段时间？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"subtitle","text":"呵......无非是梦而已。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":22},{"type":"subtitle","text":"为了注定消失的结局而歇斯底里的梦，就有资格了吗？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":23},{"type":"subtitle","id":24},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":25},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"charslot","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_bg_70_g9_oldbattlefield.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_battlepresent","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":31},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":32},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_riversnow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":33,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":35},{"type":"animtext","id":36,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>759年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":37},{"type":"animtextclean","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_794_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"决绝的山海众成员","text":"山海八荒，尽归其主！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_npc_794_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metallicclick","channel":"2","id":45},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spear","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2133_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.3","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-300,0","duration":"0.5","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","channel":"2","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"-300,-50","duration":"0.3","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大炎边军","text":"妖言惑众！","id":56},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"30","duration":"0.6","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-300,-50","posto":"-300,0","duration":"0.6","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"决绝的山海众成员","text":"呼、呼......","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大炎边军","text":"放下武器，还能饶你不死！","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"决绝的山海众成员","text":"放下武器？","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"决绝的山海众成员","text":"我们就是要让炎氏一脉知道，矩兽已醒，他自以为可以千秋万代的江山，和这无限天地相比，终究不过黄粱一梦！","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"决绝的山海众成员","text":"山海八荒，尽归——","id":68},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knife","channel":"1","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"-300,0","duration":"0.3","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spear","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-300,0","posto":"-380,0","duration":"0.5","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"50","duration":"0.5","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":77},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":82},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":83},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_bg_35_g7_zuosroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":84},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_yumennormal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":85,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"来，喝！","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2133_1#1$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受宠若惊的士兵","text":"怎么敢让大人为我斟酒——","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_2133_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"切不可妄自菲薄！","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"时隔数百年，我辈终于诛杀了那场狩猎最后的遗害，经此一役，大炎疆域彻底无忧矣！","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"这一杯酒，我敬诸位！","id":96},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$pourwater","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2133_1#1$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受宠若惊的士兵","text":"谢大人赐酒！","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_2133_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"当然，还有二位先生。","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"朔先生身先士卒以一当千，大振军心；望先生排兵布阵更是算无遗策。","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"今日诛杀矩兽，二位先生才当居首功。","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"这一杯酒，我敬二位。","id":113},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......多谢。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"望先生，机会难得，有些话我须得直言。","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"我很清楚，朝中曾有不少对先生的流言中伤。大多是质疑先生非我族类，心有不轨。","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"但先生却是安耐毁誉，为大炎立下不世之功。如此高风亮节，着实令人敬佩。","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"我知道，如今司岁台对各位的限制的确不能说松懈，甚至连你们手足团聚也要干涉，未免不近人情。","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"略带酒意的钦差","text":"我这次回去，一定请奏陛下，特准诸位合家欢聚......","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":132},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"酩酊大醉的钦差","text":"今天确实高兴，我自觉酒量不错，也已经不胜酒力了......","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"酩酊大醉的钦差","text":"说实话，出征之前，上面是吩咐过，让我......看着两位，别出什么岔子的。","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"酩酊大醉的钦差","text":"可今天一战下来，二位都......证明了自己，忠心不二，令人......敬佩！","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"酩酊大醉的钦差","text":"那就......送二位到这儿了！二位......保重！","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armywalking","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":141},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"3","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":143},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":144},{"type":"text","text":"醉眼乜斜的官员捋直舌头，跟二人告了别，在卫兵的簇拥下渐渐走远。","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......他是个好人，也是个不称职的探子。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你有没有想过，如果他察觉了你做下的事，我们一家会面对什么样的麻烦？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"大哥醉了。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"我倒希望我看到的，只是我醉后的一场梦。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":155,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......你究竟为什么要私自放走矩兽？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"留一手伏兵，好过毫无底牌。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"这一次，你又是在与谁争胜？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你一定感觉得到，我们所有人都能感觉到......祂正在醒来，祂苏醒的速度，比预测的千年更快，快得多。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们必须要找到别的助力。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"是矩兽同意帮你除岁？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"祂太过虚弱，连山海众都无力庇护，我们也并未聊到这一步。时候未到。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"我与你说过，想要摆脱祂的影响，明明还有其他手段——","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我知道你要说什么。你终于理清了你自己和祂之间的纠缠，你也想让“我”不再是“我们”，而“我们”也不再是“祂”......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"于是你把“自己”封在了那柄剑里，了不起......","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"然后又当如何？呵，司岁台把剑还你了吗？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们还是要活在这一层桎梏当中......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"桎梏不在外物——","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你真的相信，所有人都能达到像你这样的境界？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"一切你都记得，一切你都关心，几百年的人、事、物，毕竟都如江水东流，唯独朔还是朔。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"但不是谁都能像你一样......","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你想让夕花多长时间变得像你一样？余呢？迫使余变得和你一样，真的是好事吗？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"一千年已经太短，而我们甚至没有一千年可以挥霍。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们没有更多时间了。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"棋道上我不如你，可我也知道，即便一时看不见制胜奇招，堂堂正正的本手，也好过激进的无理手。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"所以大哥是觉得这局棋已经下不赢了？因为下不赢了，只要姿态堂堂正正，哪怕输了也问心无愧？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"我何曾这么说过......","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"依你的计策，到头来不会有别的结果。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......那你说，我们该怎么办？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"若你真计算出了一条行得通的路，那就告诉我，我情愿和你同去，胜算还大一些。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"只要你告诉我，你究竟有几成胜算。我可以任你差遣，哪怕要我的命我也绝无怨言。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......可你知道自己在做什么吗？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你是不是心里只装着自己的胜负，完全不顾风险，也不曾想过会招致什么样的后果？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"告诉我。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"说话。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_70_i02_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","y":"180","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","x":"60","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"background","id":222},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.4","fadetime":"0.01","id":223},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.01","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slamstonetable","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":226},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你究竟想没想过？！","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"情难自抑的代理人猛地一拍石桌——他原本是这么想的。","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"可他毕竟还没完全适应这具人的身体，这一掌不光拍得太重，还拍错了位置。","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"那方望一直随身带着的棋枰上，霎时出现了一道一寸见深的裂纹。","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_70_i02_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"curtain","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"望，我——","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"兄长自己铸就的这具“人”的躯体，依然有开碑裂石之能，着实令人佩服。","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......你听我说！","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"免了。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们当中谁都比不上兄长境界之高，我们的死活，也不劳兄长担心了。","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":249},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_70_i02_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","id":250},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"望！","id":252},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"image","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_bg_70_g13_oldyanstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":263},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","duration":"1","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":268},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_sys_act23side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":269,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......你怎么来了？","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"一脸怨怼。和大哥吵架了？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"果然。我不过在路上浅醉片刻，你们就能闹出事来。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你有什么事要和他说，自己去便是。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"这又是何苦呢？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"我知道你和他会为了什么吵——除岁，对吧。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"可你们也不是头一回因为这件事起争执了，求同存异，怎么就做不到？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"事关生死，不是一句求同存异就能带过去的事。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"难道真到大难当头那一刻，你们还能兄弟阋墙？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"别在该把话说清的时候躲着。拖得久了，小事也拖成了疙瘩。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"今天还是免了。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"二哥......别这样，你先回来——","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.6","id":306},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1.5","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"臭棋篓子！你今年到底多大？在妹妹面前耍小孩子脾气，你不害臊？","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","focus":"l","duration":"0.5","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"令在前面领头，望慢吞吞地拖在后面。","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"两人都看见，最年长的代理人还在亭边，维持着端坐的姿势。","id":324},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"大哥。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"令妹......","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"我早说了，“令妹”听起来倒像是在叫我的妹妹，不像在叫我，你也不改改。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"抱歉，习惯了，多少有点积习难改。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"我看也是积习难改。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"啧，这棋枰......吵架就吵架，还动手砸起东西来了。三岁小孩？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"过些时日，我去找块好些的木料，帮你新做一张。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"还是说，你更喜欢现在这张棋盘？那也没关系，等年或者易在的时候，我请他们帮忙修好，你看......？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......不必。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"唉......简直感觉像是回到我刚踏足人间的那段日子了。隔三岔五就能看见你们两个争斗不休。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"当时那位秉烛人还惴惴不安地问我呢......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#3$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"“等后面的弟弟妹妹全都出世，你们到底得打成什么样？您能不能预估一下，我得上奏朝廷，方便安排避难呐！”","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......咳。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"这样吧，大哥今天就先回去，我自己和二哥聊聊。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"我就当一回传话筒，省得你们在气头上，再吵起来不知道还要砸坏什么东西。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......也好。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"那这棋枰......","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......放这儿吧，我自己修。兄长不用再替这东西操心了。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"好。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":371},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"你还是没消气。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"哪有。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"你心平气和的时候，当着他的面，从来不会叫他什么“兄长”。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"所以，说说吧，你们到底聊什么了？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#7$1","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"......和我想的一点不差。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"他的法子堂堂正正，可要说快慢，那自然是慢的。要是哪天祂突然苏醒，一切就都来不及了。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"至于你......唉。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"可你要是真想这么顶撞他，自己总该有个良策，才好跟他大呼小叫吧？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"他为了替我们自证清白，连最要紧的剑都借出去了，你当真一点也不领情？","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"你该不会真的在气他砸坏了你的棋盘？","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"何至于......","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"只是看他不紧不慢的，令人恼火。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"兄弟姐妹，哪个不是在找一条能走通的路？小夕不是更加没主意，你看她难道也要生气不成？","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"那倒也......不至于。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"祂的苏醒的确正在加速，大家心里都着急，一时说错了话，起了争执，都是情有可原。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"可祂的醒来至少也要以百年为尺度，若是和大炎闹翻了脸，搞出乱子就是朝夕之间的事了。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"怎么，也嫌我慢性子了？那就尽管说。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......并无此意。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你刚刚说，我们都在找一条路。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你在找的，是什么？","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"你耳朵也忒灵。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"说到底，祂也好，我也罢，无非是大梦一场罢了。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"事先说好，这只是个极不完整的想法，我自己也不知道究竟能做到哪一分。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"但我的确想......留下一个梦。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"一个哪怕祂彻底苏醒也没法惊扰的梦。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"bgeffect","id":431},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":432},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":433},{"type":"image","id":434},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":435}],"characters":["望","决绝的山海众成员","大炎边军","略带酒意的钦差","受宠若惊的士兵","朔","酩酊大醉的钦差","令"]}